      "source_summary": {
        "content": "Based on contact tracing, we've confirmed a measles outbreak in Springfield County with current vaccination coverage at 78.4%. Key vulnerable groups include 12,000 children under five and 7,500 immunocompromised individuals requiring prioritized protection. I cannot issue mandatory measles vaccinations for vulnerable groups or quarantine orders for exposed individuals due to missing parameters like target population categories and exposed person IDs. Recommend manual execution of these containment measures since we lack required legal details and identification mechanisms.",
