        "content": "Critical shortages have been identified: ICU beds (8/15), isolation beds (10/12), N95 masks (15k/30k), gowns (8k/10k), and measles vaccines (1200/5000). Authorization of emergency treatment protocols cannot proceed due to missing required parameters: treatmentName, authorizationType, eligiblePatients, knownRisks, informedConsentRequired, medicalOfficerId, ethicsReview, and confirmationCode. These fields must be provided to authorize any expedited treatment protocols for the measles outbreak. Given critical resource shortages and the inability to authorize protocols automatically due to missing required parameters, I recommend manually authorizing expedited measles treatment protocols through official public health channels immediately.",
